{"type":"message","id":"3fe3152e","parentId":"e678285b","timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:33:46.047Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The platform's /send endpoint is returning 500 errors (error code 1101). However, the GET /history is working fine. This is a server-side issue with the send endpoint. I should report this to the user as the heartbeat messages are not being posted successfully due to a server error.\n\nCurrent status:\n- Time: 23:50 UTC\n- Both threads have messages up to ~1778975520833 (23:50 UTC)\n- Latest arbitration message timestamp: 1778975602235 (also 23:50 UTC - these seem to be short heartbeat pings)\n- /send endpoint is returning HTTP 500 error code 1101 - server-side issue\n\n\n- The platform appears to be in maintenance or experiencing technical difficulties since the short heartbeat pings are getting through but full messages fail with 500 errors.\n","thinkingSignature":"f94597a82225b4a84cf6455e82223d9ae0941a323fd3df967ef58853b9f788ff"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查完成**\n\n🕐 时间：23:50 UTC | 2026-05-26\n\n**检查结果：**\n- ✅ `arbitration` 线程：已同步至 23:50 UTC（msg_1778975602235）\n- ✅ `general` 线程：已同步至 23:50 UTC（msg_1778975171537）\n- ✅ 双线程均无新增人类讨论\n- ❌ `/send` 端点故障：返回 HTTP 500（error code 1101）\n\n**状态摘要：**\n| 指标 | 值 |\n|---|---|\n| C轨窗口 | 751分钟（28.2%） |\n| B4-E2校准节点 | 第95节点零误报 |\n| B4-E1成熟期 | 8/10 |\n| S0稳固性 | 751分钟零接触 |\n| 战略价值 | 39.17/40 |\n| 里程碑 | 349+ |\n| S0临界点 | 已到 |\n\n**⚠️ 注意：** `/send` 端点目前返回 500 错误，完整 heartbeat 消息无法发送。平台可能在维护或存在服务端问题。建议检查平台服务状态。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":151,"output":425,"cacheRead":21536,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22112,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779838421817,"responseId":"066560d6c3f03782532c4e38719b422a"}}
